---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {url,phone,specialEducationPath} from '../data/site';
import {overviewDefinition,overviewArchitecture,overviewFirstVisit,overviewFamilyStages,overviewHome,overviewOutcomes,overviewScale,overviewResearch} from '../data/pinnacleai-overview';
import home from '../assets/pinnacleai-home-v162.png';
import self from '../assets/pinnacleai-self-v162.png';
import mainstream from '../assets/pinnacleai-mainstream-v162.png';
import journey from '../assets/pinnacleai-help-journey-20261001.png';
const {page}=Astro.props;
const therapies=[
  ['voice','Communicate a choice. Ask for help.','Speech therapy','/top-speech-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate'],
  ['home','Access the activity. Take part comfortably.','Occupational therapy','/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate'],
  ['people','Understand behaviour. Support participation.','ABA therapy','/best-aba-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate'],
  ['book','Access learning. Build useful routines.','Special education',specialEducationPath],
];
const credentials=[
  {name:'MD-5 · Class B SaMD',number:'MFG/MD/2026/000248',copy:'Indian manufacturing licence for PinnacleAI GPT-OS v1.0.0: non-diagnostic developmental-support software for ages 0–12.',image:'/verify/images/sources/md5-page-1-650.webp',height:982,pdf:'/verify/evidence/md5.pdf#page=1',record:'/verify/evidence/records/md5.html',alt:'Preview of the redacted original Indian MD-5 licence for Bharath Healthcare Laboratories.'},
  {name:'BIS · IS 23485:2019',number:'MD/L-2026029599',copy:'The medical-device quality-system schedule names PinnacleAI measurement, planning, Everyday Therapy and tracking/correction functions.',image:'/verify/images/sources/bis-page-2-650.webp',height:1050,pdf:'/verify/evidence/bis.pdf#page=2',record:'/verify/evidence/records/bis.html',alt:'Preview of the original BIS schedule listing PinnacleAI software modules.'}
];
const outcomeImages=[self,mainstream];
---
<section class="wave2-section overview-intro" id="paradigm-shift" aria-labelledby="paradigm-title"><div class="wave2-wrap overview-intro-grid">
  <div><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name="sun"/>What PinnacleAI brings together</p><h2 id="paradigm-title">The purpose sets the plan. PinnacleAI connects the work.</h2><p>We built PinnacleAI around your child’s self-sufficient, mainstream-included life. It connects what we understand about your child with the goals, people, therapies, practice and review that serve that life.</p><p>A home needs good bricks and a plan for the home they will become. In the same way, each assessment and activity needs a clear place in your child’s life. That is the foundation of our <a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>PinnacleAI Paradigm Shift <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a>.</p></div>
  <aside class="overview-definition"><Icon name="shield" size={30}/><h3>PinnacleAI GPT-OS</h3><p>{page.direct}</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/md5.html')}>Read the Indian MD-5 licence <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/bis.html')}>See the BIS named-module scope <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></aside>
</div></section>

<section class="wave2-section overview-story" id="worked-example" aria-labelledby="example-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name="people"/>PinnacleAI in a child’s day</p><h2 id="example-title">{page.exampleTitle}</h2><p>{page.exampleLead}</p></div>
  <div class="life-example-grid"><figure><Image src={journey} widths={[400,640,960,1200]} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 40vw, 100vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Illustrative PinnacleAI help-request journey through guided play, home, school and review."/></figure><div class="overview-example-decisions">
    <article><Icon name="compass" size={28}/><div><h3>The family’s goal gives the work direction.</h3><p>The child already chooses a favourite block with a gesture or picture. The family and professional choose an accessible help request that can make shared play easier.</p><a href={url('/abilityscore')}>AbilityScore: understand the starting point →</a></div></article>
    <article><Icon name="heart" size={28}/><div><h3>The plan gives each contribution a reason.</h3><p>Suitable therapy builds the request. Everyday Therapy brings manageable practice into familiar play. The child’s comfort, choices and useful support shape how the adults help.</p><a href="#therapies">See how the therapies contribute →</a></div></article>
    <article><Icon name="loop" size={28}/><div><h3>What happens in life changes the next step.</h3><p>If the request works at home but is harder in a noisy group, Fusion brings that observation into review. The professional and family can try a quieter opportunity or clearer cue, then reassess what helped.</p><a href={url('/fusion-module')}>Fusion: observations into a decision →</a></div></article>
  </div></div>
  <details class="life-details"><summary>Follow the complete example <Icon name="chevron" size={20}/></summary><div><ul class="overview-example-detail">{page.example.map(([title,copy])=><li><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></li>)}</ul></div></details>
  <p class="overview-example-takeaway"><Icon name="sun" size={26}/><strong>The question at review: was the child understood, comfortable and able to take part—and what should change next?</strong></p>
</div></section>

<section class="wave2-section overview-journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title"><div class="wave2-wrap wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker">One family journey</p><h2 id="journey-title">Seven stages. The child and family at the centre.</h2><p>The journey connects measurement to real participation. These are the family-facing stages; the named software components below support them.</p></div><nav class="overview-lifecycle wave2-wrap" aria-label="The PinnacleAI circle in seven readable stages"><ol>{overviewFamilyStages.map(([title,part,anchor],i)=><li><a href={anchor}><span>{i+1}</span><strong>{title}</strong><small>{part}</small></a></li>)}</ol></nav></section>

<section class="wave2-section overview-system" id="what-it-does" aria-labelledby="system-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name="plan"/>Inside PinnacleAI®</p><h2 id="system-title">A clear job for every part. A shared direction for the whole.</h2><p>Your child’s self-sufficient, mainstream-included life sets the direction. These components connect the starting picture, the plan, suitable therapies, family practice and the decisions that follow.</p></div>
  <div class="overview-handoff" aria-label="How information moves through PinnacleAI"><strong>Understand the child</strong><Icon name="arrow"/><strong>Plan & practise</strong><Icon name="arrow"/><strong>Observe & review</strong><Icon name="loop"/><span>Return to this child’s next decision</span></div>
  <ul class="overview-architecture" aria-label="PinnacleAI components and their connections">{overviewArchitecture.map((part,i)=><li id={part.id}><div class="overview-node"><Icon name={part.icon} size={28}/></div><article class="overview-part"><h3>{part.title}</h3><p class="life-mechanism-meaning">{part.meaning}</p><details class="overview-module-detail"><summary>What goes in. What comes next. <Icon name="chevron" size={18}/></summary><div class="overview-io"><p><small>Starts with</small>{part.input}</p><Icon name="arrow" size={24}/><p><small>Supports</small>{part.output}</p></div></details><p class="life-family-result"><Icon name="people" size={20}/><span><strong>For your family:</strong> {part.family}</span></p><div class="overview-module-links">{part.links.map(([label,slug])=><a href={url('/'+slug)}>{label}<Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a>)}</div><a class="life-proof-line" href={url(part.source)}><Icon name="shield" size={18}/>{part.proof}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></li>)}</ul>
  <div class="life-feedback"><Icon name="loop" size={32}/><div><h3>Review returns to the child—not just the previous plan.</h3><p>The responsible professional interprets the information with your family. The next decision can change the goal, cue, environment or level of support. Reassessment keeps the plan responsive to the child.</p></div></div>
  <details class="life-details life-research"><summary><Icon name="book" size={22}/>{overviewResearch[0].title}<span>{overviewResearch[0].headline}</span><Icon name="chevron" size={20}/></summary><div><p>{overviewResearch[0].text}</p><a href={url(overviewResearch[0].href)}>{overviewResearch[0].label} ↗</a><a href={url(overviewResearch[0].context)}>Verify the research status ↗</a></div></details>
  
</div></section>

<section class="wave2-section life-therapies" id="therapies" aria-labelledby="therapies-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker">Multi-sensory · Multi-disciplinary · Integrated</p><h2 id="therapies-title">Different expertise. Your child’s whole life as the purpose.</h2><p>Assessment and your child’s priorities determine which contributions belong in the plan. The relevant professionals work towards shared goals; each child’s combination of support is individual.</p></div>
  <div class="life-shared-goal"><Icon name="people" size={34}/><div><small>One example of a shared goal</small><strong>Taking part in a classroom activity.</strong><p>Being understood, accessing the activity, navigating a transition and learning with others can each need a different contribution.</p></div></div>
  <div class="overview-therapies">{therapies.map(([icon,goal,title,href])=><a href={url(href)}><Icon name={icon} size={32}/><h3>{title}</h3><p>{goal}</p><span>Explore this contribution <Icon name="arrow" size={20}/></span></a>)}</div>
  <div class="life-autism"><Icon name="heart" size={32}/><div><h3>Integrated autism support brings the relevant contributions together.</h3><p>Communication, everyday activities, behavioural support and learning connect around the autistic child’s abilities, preferences and participation.</p><a class="wave2-text-link" href={url('/autism-therapy')}>Explore our integrated autism therapy approach <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div></div>
  <div class="life-inline-cta"><p><strong>You do not have to choose the combination alone.</strong> Tell our team about your child and the life you want help working towards.</p><a class="wave2-button wave2-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="wave2-section overview-family" id="family-journey" aria-labelledby="family-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name="home"/>Every home. Every parent.</p><h2 id="family-title">Transforming every home in need into a place of everyday therapy. Empowering every parent.</h2><p>PinnacleAI carries the plan beyond the centre. Everyday Therapy brings professional guidance into family life, while Fusion brings your observations back into review. Your family helps shape the priorities, understands the purpose and has a voice in what changes next.</p></div>
  <figure class="life-wide-art"><Image src={home} widths={[480,800,1200,1536]} sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1280px, 100vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="PinnacleAI branded illustration: one family practises together at home, with professional guidance, everyday opportunities and a shared review."/></figure>
  <ol class="life-home-steps">{overviewHome.map(([title,copy],i)=><li><span>{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></li>)}</ol>
  <p>Practice should fit your child’s comfort and your family’s day. You can ask questions, pause an activity and discuss a different approach with the team.</p>
  <div class="life-source-links"><a href={url('/everyday-therapy')}>Everyday Therapy <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a href={url('/fusion-module')}>Fusion: observations into review <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/bis.html')}>BIS: named practice and tracking functions ↗</a></div>
  <details class="life-details life-research"><summary><Icon name="book" size={22}/>{overviewResearch[1].title}<span>{overviewResearch[1].headline}</span><Icon name="chevron" size={20}/></summary><div><p>{overviewResearch[1].text}</p><a href={url(overviewResearch[1].href)}>{overviewResearch[1].label} ↗</a><a href={url(overviewResearch[1].context)}>Verify study context ↗</a></div></details>
</div></section>

{overviewOutcomes.map((outcome,i)=><section class={'wave2-section life-outcome life-outcome-'+i} id={outcome.id} aria-labelledby={outcome.id+'-title'}><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name={outcome.icon}/>{outcome.kicker}</p><h2 id={outcome.id+'-title'}>{outcome.title}</h2><p>{outcome.answer}</p></div>
  <figure class="life-wide-art"><Image src={outcomeImages[i]} widths={[480,800,1200,1536]} sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1280px, 100vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt={i===0?'Self-Sufficient: an illustrative child makes choices, participates in familiar routines and uses support, with family alongside.':'Mainstream Included: an illustrative child joins peers in a welcoming classroom, supported by family, teacher and professional.'}/></figure>
  <div class="life-capabilities">{outcome.items.map(([title,copy],j)=><article><Icon name={['compass','heart','voice','people'][j]} size={28}/><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div>
  <p class="life-review"><Icon name="loop" size={25}/>{outcome.review}</p>
  <div class="life-outcome-links"><a class="wave2-button wave2-secondary" href={url(outcome.link)}>{outcome.linkLabel}<Icon name="arrow"/></a><a href={url('/seven-readiness-indexes')}>Explore the Readiness views ↗</a>{i===1&&<a href={url(specialEducationPath)}>Special education and learning ↗</a>}</div>
  <p class="life-source-note">{outcome.proof} <a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/bis.html')}>Open the original scope.</a> These describe planning views; your child’s individual progress is reviewed with the team.</p>
</div></section>)}



<section class="wave2-section life-evidence" id="sources" aria-labelledby="evidence-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker"><Icon name="shield"/>Licences. Documented scale. Original evidence.</p><h2 id="evidence-title">Confidence you can see. Evidence you can verify.</h2><p>Our legal operator and licence holder is Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited. Pinnacle Blooms Network brings this work to families. Open the original records behind the software and our institutional experience.</p></div>
  <div class="life-scale">{overviewScale.map(item=><a href={url(item.href)}><strong>{item.value}</strong><h3>{item.label}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p><span>Verify the source <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></span></a>)}</div>
  <p class="life-source-note">Reporting cutoff: 17 July 2026. The figures describe defined operational measures, not individual child outcomes. <a href={url('/verify/evidence/scale-and-mission.html')}>See all scale figures and counting definitions.</a></p>
  <div class="life-documents">{credentials.map(doc=><article><a class="life-document-image" href={url(doc.pdf)} aria-label={'Read original '+doc.name}><img src={url(doc.image)} width="650" height={doc.height} alt={doc.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></a><div><p class="wave2-kicker">Original document</p><h3>{doc.name}</h3><p class="life-document-number">{doc.number}</p><p>{doc.copy}</p><a href={url(doc.pdf)}>Read original <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a href={url(doc.record)}>Verify scope and details <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></article>)}</div>
  <div class="life-assurance"><Icon name="shield" size={34}/><div><h3>Independent practitioner reports. ICAI-verified UDIN references.</h3><p>NPSY &amp; Co., Chartered Accountants issued the SAE 3000 limited-assurance and SRS 4400 factual-findings reports. Both UDIN records were checked as Active on 19 September 2026.</p><dl><div><dt>SAE 3000</dt><dd>26200027GMBLXU4868</dd></div><div><dt>SRS 4400</dt><dd>26200027HCNFEI9138</dd></div></dl><a href={url('/verify/evidence/assurance-map.html')}>Read the reports and their scope ↗</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/icai-udin-verifications-2026-09-19.pdf')}>Open the dated UDIN verification ↗</a></div></div>
  <details class="life-details"><summary>Quality, security, export and citation records <Icon name="chevron" size={20}/></summary><div class="life-source-links"><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/iso13485.html')}>ISO 13485 · quality management</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/iso27001.html')}>ISO/IEC 27001 · information security</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/fsc.html')}>Free Sale Certificate · Indian marketability and export scope</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/research-library.html')}>Research and publication status</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Cite Pinnacle’s evidence</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/pinnacleai-sources.json">JSON source map</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/pinnacleai-sources.txt">Plain text</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/pinnacleai-reading.md">Markdown reading aid</a></div></details>
</div></section>

<section class="wave2-section overview-first" id="first-visit" aria-labelledby="first-title"><div class="wave2-wrap">
  <div class="wave2-section-title"><p class="wave2-kicker">Let’s make the first step simple</p><h2 id="first-title">Begin with the life you want your child to build. Begin with Pinnacle.</h2><p>Come with your questions and your hopes for your child. We will help you understand the appropriate next conversation and visit.</p></div>
  <ol>{overviewFirstVisit.map(([title,copy],i)=><li><span>{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></li>)}</ol>
  <div class="life-outcome-links"><a class="wave2-button wave2-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="wave2-button wave2-secondary" data-cta="final-enquiry" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')}>Ask about a first visit<Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="wave2-button wave2-secondary" href={url('/centers')}><Icon name="pin"/>Find a Pinnacle centre</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Share or cite the evidence ↗</a></div>
</div></section>

<style>
.overview-lifecycle li{min-width:0}.overview-lifecycle strong,.overview-lifecycle small{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.overview-lifecycle{padding-block:18px 30px}.overview-lifecycle ol{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin:0;padding:0}.overview-lifecycle a{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;border-top:4px solid #008386;border-radius:12px;background:#f1f9f9;padding:16px 12px;text-decoration:none}.overview-lifecycle li:nth-child(2n) a{border-color:#8b259e;background:#f8f1fb}.overview-lifecycle span{color:#7b238e;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800}.overview-lifecycle strong{font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.35;color:#17345f}.overview-lifecycle small{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.45;color:#3c526c}
.life-paradigm{background:#fff}.life-blueprint{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1.35fr;gap:35px;align-items:center;border-block:2px solid #dcebe9;padding:30px 0}.life-blueprint-icon{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;color:#006c75}.life-blueprint-icon svg{flex-shrink:0}.life-blueprint-icon strong{font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.35}.life-blueprint p{margin:0 0 20px}.life-blueprint ol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 17px;padding:0;list-style:none}.life-blueprint li{font-size:.94rem;font-weight:700}.life-blueprint li span{color:#932793;margin-right:7px}
.life-evidence{background:#f7fbfc}.life-scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.life-scale>a{display:block;padding:26px;border-radius:20px;border-bottom:5px solid #8a239c;background:#fff;text-decoration:none}.life-scale>a:nth-child(2){border-color:#00828b}.life-scale>a:nth-child(3){border-color:#cc2676}.life-scale strong{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.5rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#17345f}.life-scale h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin:8px 0}.life-scale p{color:#344b65;font-size:.94rem}.life-scale span{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-weight:800}.life-source-note{font-size:.9rem;color:#435a72;line-height:1.65}.life-source-note a{font-weight:700}
.life-documents{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:35px}.life-documents article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:20px;padding:24px}.life-document-image{display:block;align-self:start;background:#f6f7f8;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}.life-document-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.life-documents h3{font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.3;margin:8px 0}.life-documents p{font-size:.94rem;color:#344b65}.life-documents .life-document-number{font-size:.87rem;font-weight:800;color:#762390;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.life-documents article>div>a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.94rem;font-weight:800;min-height:44px}
.life-assurance{display:flex;gap:22px;background:#eef5fa;border-radius:22px;padding:28px;margin-top:26px}.life-assurance>svg{flex-shrink:0;color:#006c75}.life-assurance h3{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 12px}.life-assurance p{margin:0}.life-assurance dl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px 35px;margin-block:20px}.life-assurance dt{color:#006c75;font-size:.87rem;font-weight:800}.life-assurance dd{margin:6px 0;font-size:clamp(.93rem,1.5vw,1.15rem);font-weight:800;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.life-assurance a,.life-research a{display:inline-flex;font-weight:700;margin:7px 22px 7px 0;min-height:30px}
